WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.860
Berkelium which, I assume was named after
the place of its discovery,

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.160
which was Berkeley and they made 3 billionths
of a gram of it, which

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.940
was just enough to record some spectroscopic
data on it and prove that

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.119
they had actually made it.

